# condor_submit_dag supergranulation_haywood.dag :
#   1. one job per day of supergranulation_haywood_days.txt: HMI epochs, corrected 45 s dopplergrams and JPL velocities
#      of its exposures (supergranulation_haywood_day.sub)
#   2. all the days: window averages, simulations, statistics and figures (supergranulation_haywood_collect.sub; it
#      runs even if some days failed: only the complete days are used)
JOB days    supergranulation_haywood_day.sub
JOB collect supergranulation_haywood_collect.sub
PARENT days CHILD collect
SCRIPT POST days /bin/true
